I've made a small change in the devel version so that model="linear" is the default.
With the testing version of INLA, the latest inlabru devel version (and R v4) your code runs.

The convergence isn't very efficient (I'm working on the improvement for that), and I'm a bit suspicious of the large beta0 estimate, but the latter seems to be an issue with the simulated data set more than with the estimation method itself.

