  "Copying a part of the linear predictor"
sounds like what you may be looking for.
Can you write the desired model in more mathematical form? E.g. if your model should take the form covariate(s) * (beta0 + field(s)), or if it's something else you're looking for?
The code alone doesn't tell us what model you're looking for; One can only see if it's correct if it can be compared with a well-formulated model definition.

Finn

